        "detailed_description": "This game is a casual treasure-hunting adventure game with a low-poly art style. Its core gameplay revolves around collecting all the treasure chests in the open, cartoonish scenes. As seen in the screenshots, the game interface displays &quot;Total Treasures&quot; and &quot;Remaining Count,&quot; with the clear objective of &quot;finding all treasure chests in the scene.&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlayers control a character to explore fresh, vibrant environments featuring wooden huts, trees, and hills. Treasure chests are typically scattered around areas like the sides of buildings and near vegetation—each time a chest is collected, the remaining count decreases accordingly. The game also includes control hints (such as pressing the &quot;Q&quot; key to pause). With its relaxing, soothing atmosphere and slow pace, it’s ideal for players who enjoy light exploration and collection-focused gameplay. It tests players’ observation skills while letting them gain a sense of accomplishment from collecting treasures as they wander through the laid-back scenes.",
